          "type": "photo",
          "url": "https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/XPkbOI4b9TMf1PQkDvmIMz1_35ibIMSRg2pKdFnvdWm4LoxCd-CtE0vvQhwtwjf8OTSuVwNyRYjfiHg-79G0ik9aRWOv2DqqCyZeDgkiNuxA5SlbN8AWVNrhEfssaK7WDIj0nidcA9lGHJKTji9izumSwH_-ngT-iau3QVbcTsQ69Ozx5GJqZFtN1AXFLPr5GDx3F9v-As99gsev8QOsqKj5OkzSj6cfCTJ3v2h9vTqngmWVaS_JoFDJArFdJwATKe0AkBQ8TdpyjWweRXzxmsLrFoHJn-4hkgFpklgC_Lw_lzXSG6ZxSr_9g3bFY4Z_HhVmpBeoxcU-e-wR_WMIuw.jpg"
        }
